  - - `prompt.rs` — prompt execution, agent interaction, streaming event handling, auto-retry logic
  + - `prompt.rs` — prompt execution, agent interaction, streaming event handling, auto-retry logic. A fatal `StopReason::Error` (yoagent 0.14.1+: dropped tool-call arguments, or `pause_turn` with no `error_message`) is recorded in `PromptEventState::fatal_error` and surfaces as `PromptResult::FatalError` → `PromptOutcome.last_api_error` — a caller-visible error that is **never auto-retried** (surface-and-stop, #646). `into_result` checks `fatal_error` *before* `retriable_error` so a fatal message that incidentally contains a retriable keyword still stops; overflow and known-benign "stream ended" keep their existing paths.
